# What never belongs in the build context.
#
# The context is sent to the daemon before anything is built, so a directory
# here is a directory copied on every build — and two of these are worse than
# slow. bin holds the pinned tools and the compiled binaries of the host, which
# would be copied over the ones the build produces; deploy/docker/certs holds
# the development signing keys, which have no business inside an image.

.git
.github
bin
deploy/docker/certs
docs
test
*.md
LICENSE
